# Shorty — Python rewrite

FastAPI 0.110 + SQLAlchemy 2.x async + PostgreSQL 16 rewrite of the
[mikecao/shorty](https://github.com/mikecao/shorty) PHP URL shortener.

This is the **MWU-SHORTY-001 Stage 4 (CodeGen)** output of the
modernisation pipeline. Treat all files as machine-generated against the
contract in `migrations/shorty/output/planning/planning-001.md`.

## Run locally (Docker)

```bash
docker compose up --build
# API on http://localhost:8000
# DB  on localhost:5432 (user shorty / pw shorty / db shorty)
```

Create a URL:

```bash
curl 'http://localhost:8000/?url=https://example.com&format=text'
# → http://localhost:8000/b
curl -i 'http://localhost:8000/b'
# → HTTP/1.1 301 Moved Permanently
# → Location: https://example.com
```

## Run tests

```bash
pip install -e '.[test]'
pytest                  # unit + integration (SQLite in-memory)
pytest -m requires_pg   # concurrency tests (needs testcontainers-postgresql)
```

Encode-vector tests skip until Stage 6 TestGen regenerates
`tests/fixtures/encode_vectors.json` from the legacy PHP reference.

## Dual-run harness (Stage 7)

```bash
docker compose --profile parity up --build
# Python on :8000, PHP reference on :8001
# Stage 7 harness diffs response bodies after volatile-header strip.
```

## File layout

```
app/
  core/         config, logging
  db/           async engine, declarative base, alembic migrations
  modules/urls/ models, schemas, encode (pure), errors, formatting,
                dependencies, service, router
  main.py       app factory + lifespan + exception handlers
tests/
  unit/         pure-helper tests (encode, schemas, formatting)
  integration/  router+service+SQLite end-to-end
  parity/       Stage 7 dual-run scaffolding (skipped without PHP container)
  fixtures/     JSON fixture files (encode_vectors regenerated by Stage 6)
```

## Phase 1 caveats (deferred to Phase 5)

- **`Url.id` is INTEGER** — Gate 1 OQ-03; ~2.1B URL ceiling. Marked with
  `TODO(stage5-review)` in `app/modules/urls/models.py`.
- **URL regex is permissive** — Gate 1 OQ-05 preserves the legacy regex
  for parity; strict validation moves to Phase 5. Marked with
  `TODO(stage5-review)` in `app/modules/urls/schemas.py`.
- **`Accept` header negotiation** — Phase 1 uses `?format=` only (matches
  legacy); Accept-header negotiation deferred to Phase 5.

See `migrations/shorty/output/comprehension/comprehension-001.md` §5 for
the full risk-flag triage.
